			"notes": "### Release 1.1.0 - Configurable Tinted Tooltips\n\n- **Vanilla Bundle art fixed**: The default bundle now always uses the filled texture (both empty and full states) to match the dyed variants and its Vanilla 1.21 art.\n\n- **Optional tooltip tinting (off by default)**: Dyed bundles can color their tooltip background to match their dye; toggle via Mods → Bundle In Palette → Config or with a config UI mod (Configured), or set `dyedBundleTooltipColors=true` in config/bundleinpalette-client.toml.\n\n- **In‑game config screen**: Added a labeled toggle and tooltip; accessible from the Mods list so players don’t have to edit files directly."
		},
